<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Walt Disney/News Corp. venture, EU source says.</title>
<headline>EU clears Walt Disney/News Corp. venture, EU source says.</headline>
<text>
<p>BRUSSELS, Belgium - The European Commission has cleared the proposed joint venture between Walt Disney Co.'s ESPN Inc. and Star Television Ltd, a subsidiary of Rupert Murdoch's News Corp., a European Union source said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The joint venture, to be called NEWCO, would pool all the assets and licenses of ESPN's and Star Television's Asian non-standard sports television distribution businesses.</p>
<p>The operation was submitted to the Commission for clearance in October under the EU's merger rules.</p>
</text>
